{title: 132 - O Come, All Ye Faithful}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #132 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 132}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]O come, [Bm]all [G]ye [D/F#]faithful, [G]joyful and [C]triumphant,
[Em]O come [D]ye, [Am]Ocome [D/F#]ye [G]toBeth-lehem!
[Bm]Come and [Am]beholdHim, born [G]the [D/F#]King of [G]angels!
[Am/C]O [D]come, let us [C]adore Him, O [D]come, [G]let us adore Him,
[G]O [Am]come, [G]let [D/F#]us [Em]adore [C]Him, [G/D]Christ, [D7]the [G]Lord!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]Sing, choirs [Bm]of [G]angels [D/F#]sing [G]in [D/F#]exultation,
[Em]O sing [D]all [Am]ye [D]citizens [G]of [D/A]heaven [Am]above!
[Bm]Glory [Am]to [G]God, all [Am]glory [D/F#]in the [G]highest!
[Am/C]O [D]come, let us [C]adore Him, O [D]come, [G]let us adore Him,
[G]O [Am]come, [G]let [D/F#]us [Em]adore [C]Him, [G/D]Christ, [D7]the [G]Lord!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]Yea, Lord, [Bm]we [G]greet [D/F#]Thee, born [G]this [D/F#]happy [C]morning,
[Em]Jesus, [D]to [Am]Thee [D]be all [G]glory [Am]given;
[Bm]Word of [Am]the [G]Father, [Am]now [G]in [D/F#]flesh appearing!
[Am/C]O [D]come, let us [C]adore Him, O [D]come, [G]let us adore Him,
[G]O [Am]come, [G]let [D/F#]us [Em]adore [C]Him, [G/D]Christ, [D7]the [G]Lord!
{end_of_verse}
